# Schedule. Install with: python3 setup.py --install-cron
# Or paste into `crontab -e` after replacing <INSTALL> with your install path.
#
# Times are server time. The Sunday chain builds the whole coming week; the
# daily chain catches up, checks, and reports.

# The week, built in dependency order. Each step waits on the one before.
0 14 * * 0  <INSTALL>/bin/run-chain.py sunday

# Every morning: draft anything outstanding, check the system, report it.
0 6 * * *   <INSTALL>/bin/run-chain.py daily

# Publish whatever is due, every fifteen minutes.
*/15 * * * * <INSTALL>/bin/run-agent.sh publish

# Fix what the checks found. Hourly, capped at two attempts a day per fault.
25 * * * *  <INSTALL>/bin/run-agent.sh remedy

# The board.
*/5 * * * * <INSTALL>/bin/render-dashboard.py

# Back up the irreplaceable state.
30 3 * * *  <INSTALL>/bin/snapshot-state.py
